Origin: https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/ed70b1ea43a9b7ffa2f53b3e5d6ba403f37ae81c
Advisory: GHSA-www2-q4fc-65wf
Imported-by: backported to 7.2 by hand (Z_PARAM_PATH for getservbyname() name; 7.2 warning-style ZPP errors in tests; existing ZPP-message tests updated)

From 3fce1f6ef2fe1939c77ca595190c24fef3070f46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niels Dossche <7771979+nielsdos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 6 Sep 2025 21:55:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix GHSA-www2-q4fc-65wf

Backport of php-src ed70b1ea43a9b7ffa2f53b3e5d6ba403f37ae81c (PHP-8.1) to PHP 7.2:
- getservbyname() name is a char* in 7.2: Z_PARAM_PATH instead of Z_PARAM_PATH_STR
- dns_win32.c: "s" -> "p" in the existing 7.2 format strings
- test: 7.2 ZPP failures are a warning + NULL (false for inet_pton) instead of ValueError
- existing tests updated: wrong-type warnings now say "to be a valid path" instead of "to be string"
---
 ext/standard/basic_functions.c                | 12 +++---
 ext/standard/dns.c                            |  6 +--
 ext/standard/dns_win32.c                      |  6 +--
 .../getservbyname_variation1.phpt             |  8 ++--
 .../getservbyname_variation13.phpt            |  2 +-
 .../getservbyname_variation6.phpt             |  2 +-
 .../getservbyname_variation8.phpt             |  8 ++--
 .../tests/network/ghsa-www2-q4fc-65wf.phpt    | 43 +++++++++++++++++++
 ext/standard/tests/network/ip.phpt            |  2 +-
 .../tests/network/ip2long_variation1.phpt     | 12 +++---
 ext/standard/tests/network/ip_x86_64.phpt     |  2 +-
 11 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ext/standard/tests/network/ghsa-www2-q4fc-65wf.phpt

diff --git a/ext/standard/basic_functions.c b/ext/standard/basic_functions.c
index 52a67c9b..5d866feb 100644
--- a/ext/standard/basic_functions.c
+++ b/ext/standard/basic_functions.c
@@ -3939,7 +3939,7 @@ PHP_NAMED_FUNCTION(php_inet_pton)
 	char buffer[17];
 
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_START(1, 1)
-		Z_PARAM_STRING(address, address_len)
+		Z_PARAM_PATH(address, address_len)
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_END_EX(RETURN_FALSE);
 
 	memset(buffer, 0, sizeof(buffer));
@@ -3979,7 +3979,7 @@ PHP_FUNCTION(ip2long)
 #endif
 
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_START(1, 1)
-		Z_PARAM_STRING(addr, addr_len)
+		Z_PARAM_PATH(addr, addr_len)
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_END();
 
 #ifdef HAVE_INET_PTON
@@ -5660,8 +5660,8 @@ PHP_FUNCTION(getservbyname)
 	struct servent *serv;
 
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_START(2, 2)
-		Z_PARAM_STRING(name, name_len)
-		Z_PARAM_STRING(proto, proto_len)
+		Z_PARAM_PATH(name, name_len)
+		Z_PARAM_PATH(proto, proto_len)
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_END();
 
 
@@ -5705,7 +5705,7 @@ PHP_FUNCTION(getservbyport)
 
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_START(2, 2)
 		Z_PARAM_LONG(port)
-		Z_PARAM_STRING(proto, proto_len)
+		Z_PARAM_PATH(proto, proto_len)
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_END();
 
 	serv = getservbyport(htons((unsigned short) port), proto);
@@ -5729,7 +5729,7 @@ PHP_FUNCTION(getprotobyname)
 	struct protoent *ent;
 
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_START(1, 1)
-		Z_PARAM_STRING(name, name_len)
+		Z_PARAM_PATH(name, name_len)
 	ZEND_PARSE_PARAMETERS_END();
 
 	ent = getprotobyname(name);
